Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:14.00,Title,,0,0,0,,2. Walking and speaking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.35,0:00:13.80,Speech,,0,0,0,,Now I am walking and talking. My steps should feel steady and relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:21.00,Title,,0,0,0,,3. Running and speaking
